<title>POLAND: Polish shares close higher in continuous trade.</title>
<headline>Polish shares close higher in continuous trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eleven stocks rose, six fell and three were flat in 23.2-million-zloty Warsaw bourse continuous trade on Wednesday with the WIG 20 index closing at 1,670.2 points, 2.2 percent higher than at the regular session.</p>
<p>The remaining two stocks did not trade.</p>
<p>NFI units were up 0.3 percent in a 17.3-million-zloty turnover.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
